      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Markets operations professional with 3 years of experience across securities settlements, post-trade operations, exception management, reconciliations, operational controls, and corporate action income processing within global wealth management operations. Experienced in managing end-to-end settlement workflows across Equities, Fixed Income, Structured Products, and FX-related processes, investigating settlement fails and cash breaks, coordinating with custodians and brokers, and working to market deadlines and operational SLAs. Strong track record in root-cause analysis, risk mitigation, process improvement, and automation of repetitive operational workflows using Excel-based solutions. Experienced in supporting regulatory and market-driven change, including the US T+1 settlement transition.",
